SUMMARY:Lo Wolf
DESCRIPTION:FREE SHOWALL AGES\nFolk country artist Lo Wolf writes raw\, radiant\, and real music. Rooted in feeling\, her voice moves like spring. Her smoky songs that whisper and scream will stay with you. Like the coyotes in the hillsides or the wolves roaming the lands\, she brings stories and places to life through sound. Whether solo or with a band\, they bring a unique\, rebellious energy to their live sets and recordings alike. Howl along wherever you listen to music or catch a live show near you.\n  \nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates the new indoor taproom & deli\, with live music several days a week\, plus an open air outdoor bar in the summer and fall months. Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/lo-wolf-2/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
