SUMMARY:Connor Koz' Grass Underground
DESCRIPTION:Grass Underground: a weekly live music event celebrating and exploring the wide world of Bluegrass and its many influences in a unique basement setting right in the heart of downtown Asheville\, NC!\n\nHosted by Connor Koz (guitar\, vocals for Coyote Rodeo)\, he brings a rotating cast of his many friends from all over the Grass and adjacent music scenes to come join the Underground and provide a new listening experience every week.\n\nDown the alley to the right and down the stairs! Come hang out with us!\n\n\nWith two unique locations\, built inside buildings that were previously cast aside\, One World brews with the intention of fostering nourishing interaction and artistic cultural experiences. From live music to art shows\, “One World Brewing” is born from the magic that happens when the whole becomes greater than the sum of its parts. Our taprooms are intersections for people of all walks of life and different corners of the globe\, enjoying this time and place together.  Check out our upcoming schedule: click here
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/connor-koz-grass-underground/2026-05-13/
LOCATION:One World Brewing Downtown\, 10 Patton Ave\, Asheville\, NC\, 28801
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
